# The bot racing and cutting (game/bot.h). The player rides north, then turns right, towards
# the bot: the bot's own trail already blocks the player's new path, so it doesn't cut again
# (it used to weave back and forth across their line); it races alongside, on their new
# heading, while the player runs into its trail. 1st person then iso, 1 s apart; the debug
# text's last line is the bot.
wait 14
press right
wait 1
shot cut_1
wait 1
shot cut_2
wait 1
shot cut_3
press down
wait 0.3
shot cut_4
wait 1
shot cut_5
wait 1.5
shot cut_6
